Z||000004||curtis||09-02-2001||11:28 PM||||no we haven't checked for codes.  We just now got it to fire as we turn it over, but it still wont start.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Formula88||09-02-2001||11:48 PM||||You've got fuel pressure, but are you getting fuel to the cylinders?  Have you tried spraying come starting fluid into the throttle body while cranking to see if it'll fire?  The fuel pump could be running, but the injectors may not be firing.||||reg||1
Z||000006||curtis||09-02-2001||11:52 PM||||Yes we are getting fuel out of the exaust.||||reg||1
