Z||000008||Oreif||09-03-2001||12:02 AM||||Sounds like you fixed he problem but while working on it you flooded the engine. Pull a plug, if it's wet, pull them all and blow air in the cylinders. Dry off the plugs than see if it'll start.||||reg||1
